OL,3,GNEWSAFree travel pilot scheme for young
OL,4,Apeople approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren and young people who live in
OL,7,FSheffield will get free bus and tram
OL,8,Ftravel across South Yorkshire after a
OL,9,Fpilot scheme was voted through by
OL,10,Fcouncillors.
OL,12,FSheffield City Council's strategy and
OL,13,Fresources committee approved a 29-week
OL,14,Fscheme for people aged five to 18.
OL,16,FThe trial will run from 15 February
OL,17,F2027 and is expected to cost #7.6m.
OL,19,FCouncil leader Fran Belbin said it
OL,20,Fwould help families with the cost of
OL,21,Fliving and give thousands of young
OL,22,Fpeople greater independence.
